---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <main class="hero">
    <div class="glow"></div>
    <div class="embers">
      <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
      <span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span>
    </div>
    <h1>Ash Rise</h1>
    <p class="tagline">灰の中から、また立ち上がる。</p>
  </main>

  <section id="about" class="section-block">
    <div class="glow small"></div>
    <h2 class="fade-in">会社概要</h2>
    <div class="content fade-in-delay">
      <p>Ash Riseは、不死鳥が灰から蘇る伝説に由来する社名です。</p>
      <p>私たちは、何度倒れても立ち上がる強さを大切にしています。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="service" class="section-block">
    <div class="glow small"></div>
    <h2 class="fade-in">事業内容</h2>
    <p class="lead fade-in-delay">SNS運用代行 × 広告事業 × 営業代行 —— ワンストップ型 総合マーケティング支援</p>

    <div class="service-item fade-in">
      <h3>01 SNS運用代行</h3>
      <p>企業のSNSアカウント運用を代行し、企画・撮影・編集・投稿・分析までを一貫して支援します。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-item fade-in">
      <h3>02 広告事業</h3>
      <p>Instagram・TikTokを中心に、企業・店舗・賃貸物件・商品などのPRを企画・制作・配信します。</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-item fade-in">
      <h3>03 営業代行</h3>
      <p>企業の営業活動を代行し、商談・クロージングを中心とした営業支援を行います。</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" class="section-block">
    <div class="glow small"></div>
    <h2 class="fade-in">お問い合わせ</h2>
    <p class="lead fade-in-delay">SNS運用代行・広告事業・営業代行について、お気軽にご相談ください。</p>

    <form class="contact-form fade-in">
      <label>
        お名前
        <input type="text" name="name" required />
      </label>
      <label>
        会社名
        <input type="text" name="company" />
      </label>
      <label>
        メールアドレス
        <input type="email" name="email" required />
      </label>
      <label>
        お問い合わせ内容
        <textarea name="message" rows="6" required></textarea>
      </label>
      <button type="submit">送信する</button>
    </form>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    background-color: #0a0a0a;
    color: #f5f0e8;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .glow {
    position: absolute;
    width: 600px;
    height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,107,53,0.15), transparent 70%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    filter: blur(40px);
    animation: pulse 6s ease-in-out infinite;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }
  .glow.small {
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1); opacity: 0.8; }
    50% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.15); opacity: 1; }
  }
  .embers {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .embers span {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -20px;
    width: 4px;
    height: 4px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #ff8a3d;
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px 2px rgba(255,138,61,0.6);
    animation: rise linear infinite;
  }
  .embers span:nth-child(1) { left: 10%; animation-duration: 9s; animation-delay: 0s; }
  .embers span:nth-child(2) { left: 20%; animation-duration: 12s; animation-delay: 1s; }
  .embers span:nth-child(3) { left: 32%; animation-duration: 8s; animation-delay: 2.5s; }
  .embers span:nth-child(4) { left: 45%; animation-duration: 14s; animation-delay: 0.5s; }
  .embers span:nth-child(5) { left: 58%; animation-duration: 10s; animation-delay: 3s; }
  .embers span:nth-child(6) { left: 68%; animation-duration: 11s; animation-delay: 1.5s; }
  .embers span:nth-child(7) { left: 76%; animation-duration: 9s; animation-delay: 4s; }
  .embers span:nth-child(8) { left: 85%; animation-duration: 13s; animation-delay: 2s; }
  .embers span:nth-child(9) { left: 93%; animation-duration: 10s; animation-delay: 0.8s; }
  .embers span:nth-child(10) { left: 50%; animation-duration: 15s; animation-delay: 3.5s; }
  @keyframes rise {
    0% { transform: translateY(0) translateX(0); opacity: 0; }
    10% { opacity: 1; }
    50% { transform: translateY(-50vh) translateX(20px); }
    90% { opacity: 0.6; }
    100% { transform: translateY(-100vh) translateX(-15px); opacity: 0; }
  }
  .hero h1 {
    position: relative;
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 8vw, 6rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    margin: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b35, #f7931e, #ffd700);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp 1s ease-out forwards;
  }
  .tagline {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.4rem);
    color: #b8b0a0;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp 1s ease-out 0.3s forwards;
  }
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }

  .section-block {
    position: relative;
    background-color: #0a0a0a;
    color: #f5f0e8;
    padding: 6rem 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .section-block > * {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 800px;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }
  .section-block h2 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b35, #f7931e, #ffd700);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .content p {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #b8b0a0;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .lead {
    color: #b8b0a0;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  .service-item {
    border-top: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
    padding: 2rem 0;
    transition: padding-left 0.3s ease;
  }
  .service-item:hover {
    padding-left: 1rem;
  }
  .service-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    color: #ff6b35;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .service-item p {
    color: #b8b0a0;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .contact-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }
  .contact-form label {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #b8b0a0;
  }
  .contact-form input, .contact-form textarea {
    background: #1a1a1a;
    border: 1px solid #333;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.75rem;
    color: #f5f0e8;
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 1rem;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .contact-form input:focus, .contact-form textarea:focus {
    outline: none;
    border-color: #ff6b35;
  }
  .contact-form button {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b35, #f7931e);
    border: none;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 0.9rem;
    color: #0a0a0a;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }
  .contact-form button:hover {
    opacity: 0.9;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .fade-in {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out forwards;
  }
  .fade-in-delay {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
    animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out 0.2s forwards;
  }
</style>